    "detailed_description": "Join Marta, the hardest working plumber proportional to her size as she embarks on an adventure when mysteriously messy creatures begin to emerge from pipes all over town.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981370/extras/b72a640ba53d79350a738d85b1b9a5ac.avif?t=1698352775\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Every Sink is a new Adventure!</h2>In this top down 2D Rogue-Lite shooter, each trip Marta takes down the drain creates a series of randomly generates levels, giving you a unique path to explore on every run!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Battle Belligerent Bosses</h2>In between normal levels, Marta will encounter some of the greatest threats your municipal plumbing system has to offer. Can you defeat them all in a single run and keep those pipes clean for good?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981370/extras/cec608b0c16d86e0ccd723dab0ddafae.avif?t=1698352775\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlock Upgrades and Abilities</h2>Clearing levels and defeating bosses lets you make Marta permanently more powerful and unlock costumes that each have a unique set of abilities. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981370/extras/902e6c6c3ab1138f09b94f2a00577335.avif?t=1698352775\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Full Steamdeck Support</h2>With a new Linux build tested specifically on Steam Deck including cloud save support and platform specific UI updates, plumbing on the go has never been so good.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Face New Challenges In Hard Mode!</h2>After you clear Down the Drain for the first time, face Marta's final challenge and a brand-new boss fight in hard mode!",
    "about_the_game": "Join Marta, the hardest working plumber proportional to her size as she embarks on an adventure when mysteriously messy creatures begin to emerge from pipes all over town.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981370/extras/b72a640ba53d79350a738d85b1b9a5ac.avif?t=1698352775\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Every Sink is a new Adventure!</h2>In this top down 2D Rogue-Lite shooter, each trip Marta takes down the drain creates a series of randomly generates levels, giving you a unique path to explore on every run!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Battle Belligerent Bosses</h2>In between normal levels, Marta will encounter some of the greatest threats your municipal plumbing system has to offer. Can you defeat them all in a single run and keep those pipes clean for good?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981370/extras/cec608b0c16d86e0ccd723dab0ddafae.avif?t=1698352775\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlock Upgrades and Abilities</h2>Clearing levels and defeating bosses lets you make Marta permanently more powerful and unlock costumes that each have a unique set of abilities. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981370/extras/902e6c6c3ab1138f09b94f2a00577335.avif?t=1698352775\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Full Steamdeck Support</h2>With a new Linux build tested specifically on Steam Deck including cloud save support and platform specific UI updates, plumbing on the go has never been so good.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Face New Challenges In Hard Mode!</h2>After you clear Down the Drain for the first time, face Marta's final challenge and a brand-new boss fight in hard mode!",
